    "html": "<p>The distance between point charges <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{1}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{2}\"></span> is two metres. <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{1}\"></span> has a charge of 4<em>q</em> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{2}\"></span> has a charge of 9<em>q</em>. Point P is located between <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{1}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{2}\"></span> at a distance <em>x </em>from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q_{1}\"></span>. The electric potential is a minimum at point P.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is x?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4}{5}\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5}{4}\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2}{3}\"></span> m</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{2}\"></span> m</li>\n</ol>"
